 monthly" data-yearly="billed annually">billed annually</span></div><p class="mb-3.5 min-h-[30px] text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-800">For users who are serious about getting more work done.</p><div class="mb-3 h-px bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="mb-4 flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Includes everything in Pro</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">8.5x Pro usage</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">5x file storage</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Early access to features before anyone else</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Expand our extensive integration library</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Priority support</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-purple-50"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-purple-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Help drive the roadmap for new features</span></div></div><div class="relative isolate mt-5 w-full"><a href="https://platform.agpt.co/signup?plan=max" class="inline-flex h-[2.25rem] w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-2 font-sans text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-black no-underline transition-colors hover:border-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-950" data-fast-goal="pricing_plan_cta_click" data-fast-goal-plan="max" data-fast-goal-surface="pricing">Upgrade to Max</a><p class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3 w-3 text-green-600" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg>Cancel anytime</p></div></div></div></div><div class="order-3 relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-300 via-zinc-400 to-zinc-500 p-px transition-opacity md:order-none md:my-5"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[15px] bg-white p-5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(140%_70%_at_0%_0%,rgba(244,244,245,0.7),transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><h3 class="font-poppins text-[17px] font-semibold leading-[1.5rem] text-zinc-800">Team</h3><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-zinc-500">Coming soon</span></div><div class="mb-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-0.5"><span class="font-poppins text-[26px] font-medium leading-none tracking-[-1px] text-zinc-800">Contact us</span></div><p class="mb-3.5 min-h-[30px] text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-800">For teams that need collaboration, controls, and custom usage.</p><div class="mb-3 h-px bg-zinc-100"></div><div class="mb-4 flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Multi-user workspaces</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Admin controls &amp; roles</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Centralized billing &amp; seat management</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Collaboration &amp; approvals</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Security &amp; compliance options</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-stone-100"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-stone-500" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M232.49,80.49l-128,128a12,12,0,0,1-17,0l-56-56a12,12,0,1,1,17-17L96,183,215.51,63.51a12,12,0,0,1,17,17Z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-[13px] text-zinc-800">Secure access for shared integrations</span></div></div><div class="relative isolate mt-5 w-full"><a href="https://tally.so/r/2Eb9zj" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex h-[2.25rem] w-full items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-100 px-3 py-2 font-sans text-sm font-medium leading-snug text-black no-underline transition-colors hover:border-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-950" data-fast-goal="pricing_plan_cta_click" data-fast-goal-plan="team" data-fast-goal-surface="pricing">Contact sales</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><a href="/pricing" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-sans text-sm font-medium text-purple-500 no-underline transition-colors hover:text-purple-600">See full pricing &amp; compare every feature<span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></section><section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" data-fast-scroll="scroll_to_faq"><div class="faq__container"><header class="faq__head"><p class="demo__eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2 class="faq__title" id="faq-title">Questions, <em>answered.</em></h2></header><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">What is AutoGPT?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>AutoGPT is an AI agent platform: software for building, deploying, and running agents you can hand a goal to — they make a plan, then carry out every step using AI models and your everyday apps along the way. Unlike a chatbot that waits for your next message, an AutoGPT agent does the whole job itself: it can research a market, draft and send outreach, watch competitors, or keep a spreadsheet current, end to end.</p><p>You build agents whichever way suits you — describe the outcome in plain language and let AutoPilot assemble it, or wire the steps together in the visual no-code builder. Agents then run in the cloud on schedules and triggers, with every run visible in your dashboard. The platform is open source, with a hosted cloud for teams who would rather not run their own infrastructure — start from a marketplace agent or build your own from scratch.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">How does AutoGPT work?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>You create an agent by describing the outcome you want in plain English, or by wiring up the steps in the visual builder — no code needed on either path. Under the hood an agent is a graph of blocks, where each block does one job: reading email, calling an AI model, scraping a page, updating a row in a sheet. AutoGPT connects those blocks to the models and apps the task needs and runs the work in the background.</p><p>Every run is recorded step by step, so you can open the dashboard and see exactly what an agent did and why. Agents run once on demand, on a schedule — say, every morning at eight — or on a trigger like a new email or form submission. Once it&#x27;s set up, the agent keeps working without you watching, and you only step in when it needs a decision.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">What can I build with it?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Anything that&#x27;s repeatable work rather than a one-off — that&#x27;s the sweet spot for no-code AI automation. Teams use AutoGPT agents to monitor the web and send an alert the moment something changes, draft and send outreach, research prospects before a sales call, turn long documents into clean summaries, generate content briefs, triage a support queue, and keep spreadsheets and CRMs up to date without anyone touching them.</p><p>You don&#x27;t have to start from a blank canvas either: the marketplace is full of ready-made agents you can deploy in a click and then tweak to fit how you work. A good rule of thumb — if you can describe the job clearly enough to hand it to a capable assistant, you can build an AI agent for it, and the agent will keep doing it on whatever schedule or trigger you choose.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">How does AutoGPT compare to hiring a contractor?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>A contractor is the right call for judgement-heavy, one-off work — a brand redesign, a tricky migration, advice you&#x27;ll act on once. AutoGPT is built for the repeatable kind of work that comes back every day or every week. An agent runs around the clock, handles many tasks in parallel, responds in seconds rather than days, and costs a fraction of an hourly rate, because you only pay for the compute and model usage each run actually consumes.</p><p>Agents also don&#x27;t context-switch or take holidays: the daily briefing lands every morning and the competitor watch never blinks. They&#x27;re not a replacement for human judgement on novel, high-stakes decisions — they&#x27;re leverage for everything that happens again and again. Most people end up using both: a person for the bespoke work, and a handful of agents for the recurring tasks that used to eat that person&#x27;s week.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">How is AutoGPT different from Claude Code, Codex, or Perplexity?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>They solve different problems. Claude Code and Codex help you write code, and Perplexity answers questions with sources — they assist you, in the moment, while you&#x27;re actively prompting them. AutoGPT is an AI agent platform: you build agents that run on their own, across your apps, on a schedule or a trigger, doing the whole job end to end rather than the part you&#x27;re working on right now.</p><p>Put differently, an assistant helps you draft one reply; an agent clears the queue while you&#x27;re in a meeting. The two are complementary — plenty of AutoGPT users still reach for a coding assistant or an answer engine during the day, then let agents own the recurring work. For a side-by-side look at how AutoGPT stacks up against automation tools and agent frameworks, see our <a href="/compare">comparison pages</a> covering Zapier, n8n, LangChain, and more.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">Can I use AutoGPT for free?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Yes, if you&#x27;re technical: AutoGPT is <a href="https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open source</a>, so you can self-host the whole platform for free on your own infrastructure — you bring your own model API keys and hardware, and there&#x27;s no licence fee or seat limit. Everything you build there maps over to the cloud later if you switch.</p><p>The hosted cloud doesn&#x27;t have a free tier, and that&#x27;s deliberate: every agent run uses real compute and paid AI-model usage that we cover on your behalf, so a free plan would mean throttling agents into uselessness. Instead, each plan includes enough usage to put agents to work from day one — AutoPilot Chat, the visual builder, the marketplace, and a credit wallet for your agents&#x27; runs. If you want to kick the tyres before paying, self-hosting is the genuinely free path — and the open-source repo is the same codebase the cloud runs.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">What are credits, and what counts as usage?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Running agents is pay-as-you-go: each run draws from a pre-paid credit wallet you can top up any time, and the rate is the same on every plan — you never pay a premium per task for being on a smaller tier. Usage is what your agents actually consume: the AI-model calls they make, the compute their blocks use, and any premium integrations they touch along the way.</p><p>Light agents cost very little per run; heavy research agents cost more, and the dashboard shows exactly what every run consumed, so there are no surprises at the end of the month. Your subscription (Pro or Max) sets how much AutoPilot Chat usage is included — that&#x27;s the main difference between the plans. In short: the subscription covers chat, the credit wallet covers the agents you run, and the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a> has the full breakdown.</p></div></details><details class="faq__item" name="faq"><summary class="faq__q">Can I self-host AutoGPT?<svg class="faq__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Yes. AutoGPT is open source, and you can run the entire platform yourself with a single Docker Compose command — on Linux, WSL, Podman, even a Raspberry Pi. Self-hosting is free: you bring your own model API keys and infrastructure, and you get the same visual builder, block library, and agent runtime the cloud runs.</p><p>It&#x27;s the right choice when data can&#x27;t leave your network, when you want full control over models and costs, or when you simply like running your own stack. The hosted cloud is the managed, zero-setup alternative — we run the servers, cover model usage through your plan, and keep everything up to date. Plenty of teams prototype in the cloud and move sensitive workloads on-prem later, or start self-hosted and graduate to the cloud as they scale. Start from the <a href="https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repo</a>, or follow the self-hosting guide in the <a href="https://agpt.co/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">docs</a>.</p></div></details><p class="faq__foot">Still have a question? Read the <a href="https://agpt.co/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">docs</a> or <a href="https://discord.com/invite/autogpt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ask in Discord</a>.</p></div></section><footer class="site-footer" aria-labelledby="site-footer-heading"><h2 id="site-footer-heading" class="sr-only">AutoGPT footer</h2><div class="site-footer__hairline" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-16"><div class="flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between lg:gap-16"><div class="lg:max-w-sm"><a href="/" aria-label="AutoGPT home" class="inline-flex rounded-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white/50 focus-visible:ring-offset-4 focus-visible:ring-offset-zinc-950"><img src="/logo.png" alt="AutoGPT" width="790" height="356" class="h-9 w-auto" decoding="async"/></a><p class="mt-5 max-w-xs text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55">Stop building workflows. Start hiring agents.</p><ul role="list" class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2.5"><li><a href="https://github.com/Significant-Gravitas/AutoGPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-footer__social" aria-label="AutoGPT on GitHub"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="https://x.com/Auto_GPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-footer__social" aria-label="AutoGPT on X"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.901 1.153h3.68l-8.04 9.19L24 22.846h-7.406l-5.8-7.584-6.638 7.584H.474l8.6-9.83L0 1.154h7.594l5.243 6.932ZM17.61 20.644h2.039L6.486 3.24H4.298Z"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="https://discord.com/invite/autogpt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-footer__social" aria-label="AutoGPT on Discord"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.317 4.3698a19.7913 19.7913 0 00-4.8851-1.5152.0741.0741 0 00-.0785.0371c-.211.3753-.4447.8648-.6083 1.2495-1.8447-.2762-3.68-.2762-5.4868 0-.1636-.3933-.4058-.8742-.6177-1.2495a.077.077 0 00-.0785-.037 19.7363 19.7363 0 00-4.8852 1.515.0699.0699 0 00-.0321.0277C.5334 9.0458-.319 13.5799.0