arted_click" data-fast-goal-surface="footer">Get started</a></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 lg:mt-14"><div class="site-footer__hairline" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><p class="text-[13px] text-white/45">© <span>2026</span> AutoGPT</p><ul role="list" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2"><li><a class="site-footer__link" href="/legal/platform-privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li><a class="site-footer__link" href="/legal/platform-terms-of-use">Terms of Use</a></li><li><button type="button" class="site-footer__link cookie-settings-link">Cookie settings</button></li></ul></div></div></div></footer><div id="sticky-cta" class="sticky-cta" aria-hidden="true" inert=""><div class="sticky-cta__inner"><div class="sticky-cta__copy"><span class="sticky-cta__title">Get 10 hours back every week.</span><span class="sticky-cta__sub">AI agents that finish the work</span></div><a href="https://platform.agpt.co/tour/chat?utm_source=website_sticky_cta" class="sticky-cta__demo" aria-label="See AutoGPT in action in a 60-second demo" data-fast-goal="demo_tour_click" data-fast-goal-surface="sticky_cta"><svg class="sticky-cta__demo-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5.5 4.25 6 3.75-6 3.75v-7.5Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="sticky-cta__demo-label">See it work</span><span class="sticky-cta__demo-duration" aria-hidden="true">· 60s</span></a><a href="https://platform.agpt.co/signup?plan=pro&amp;billing=yearly" class="sticky-cta__btn" aria-label="Start with Pro at $42.50 per month billed annually" data-fast-goal="get_started_click" data-fast-goal-surface="sticky_cta"><span aria-hidden="true" class="sticky-cta__glow"></span>Start with Pro<span class="sticky-cta__price">$42.50/mo</span><svg class="sticky-cta__arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="