ap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-poppins text-[26px] font-medium leading-none text-zinc-800\",\"data-monthly\":\"$$50.00\",\"data-yearly\":\"$$42.50\",\"children\":\"$$42.50\"}],\"$L43\"]}],\"$L44\",\"$L45\",\"$L46\",\"$L47\",\"$L48\"]}]]}]}],\"$L49\",\"$L4a\"]}]}],\"$L4b\"]}]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"17:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"faq\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"faq-title\",\"data-fast-scroll\":\"scroll_to_faq\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__head\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"demo__eyebrow\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__title\",\"id\":\"faq-title\",\"children\":[\"Questions, \",[\"$\",\"em\",null,{\"children\":\"answered.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__item\",\"name\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__q\",\"children\":[\"What is AutoGPT?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__icon\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"2\",\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__a\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"AutoGPT is an AI agent platform: software for building, deploying, and running agents you can hand a goal to — they make a plan, then carry out every step using AI models and your everyday apps along the way. Unlike a chatbot that waits for your next message, an AutoGPT agent does the whole job itself: it can research a market, draft and send outreach, watch competitors, or keep a spreadsheet current, end to end.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You build agents whichever way suits you — describe the outcome in plain language and let AutoPilot assemble it, or wire the steps together in the visual no-code builder. Agents then run in the cloud on schedules and triggers, with every run visible in your dashboard. The platform is open source, with a hosted cloud for teams who would rather not run their own infrastructure — start from a marketplace agent or build your own from scratch.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__item\",\"name\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__q\",\"children\":[\"How does AutoGPT work?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__icon\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"2\",\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"d\":\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__a\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"You create an agent by describing the outcome you want in plain English, or by wiring up the steps in the visual builder — no code needed on either path. Under the hood an agent is a graph of blocks, where each block does one job: reading email, calling an AI model, scraping a page, updating a row in a sheet. AutoGPT connects those blocks to the models and apps the task needs and runs the work in the background.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Every run is recorded step by step, so you can open the dashboard and see exactly what an agent did and why. Agents run once on demand, on a schedule — say, every morning at eight — or on a trigger like a new email or form submission. Once it's set up, the agent keeps working without you watching, and you only step in when it needs a decision.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__item\",\"name\":\"faq\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__q\",\"children\":[\"What can I build with it?\",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"faq__icon\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":\"2\",\"strokeLine